### Comparison of Dev Environment vs. Production


| Step | Development (Local) | Production (Vercel) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Execution** | `npm run dev` (Always running) | Serverless Function (Wakes up on request) |
| **Connection** | Polling (Knocking) | Webhooks (The Phone Call) |
| **Secrets** | `.env` file | Vercel Dashboard Variables |

